From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000002 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: contactvenkatd <contactvenkatd@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 9 Sep 2026 10:00:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] OAuth client wiring and credential integration

Wires Google OAuth sign-in, gates the first-run intro flow, and adapts
the password manager / autofill paths for external credential providers.
Requires a locally registered GCP OAuth client (see docs/BUILDING.md).

---
diff --git a/chrome/browser/extensions/external_provider_impl.cc b/chrome/browser/extensions/external_provider_impl.cc
index c095d467fd..1fa1887756 100644
--- a/chrome/browser/extensions/external_provider_impl.cc
